title: Confronting the Authoritarian Right
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: (ceda_r >= 20 or coup_progress >= 3 or radicalization >= 3) and confronting_nazis_timer == 0 and iron_front_formed == 0
on-arrival: confronting_nazis_seen += 1; confronting_nazis_timer = 5; month_actions += 1;
card-image: img/es/events/popular_front_rally.png
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

= Confronting the Authoritarian Right

The <span style="color: #0087DC;">**CEDA**</span>'s strength is gaining, as shown by their recent election results, and the monarchist and <span style="color: #14322a;">Falange</span> militias grow bolder in the streets. This threatens to plunge the Republic once again into crisis.

Many in our party are calling for urgent action. The anti-fascist mobilization current has formed specifically around this cause. But many in all factions of the party are calling for action.

- @not_a_big_deal: The authoritarian right's moment will pass. Let's not get too hasty.
- @economic_crisis
- @major_crisis: We must do something to confront the authoritarian right.
- @iron_front

@not_a_big_deal
on-arrival: nazi_urgency -= 1; left_dissent += 5; neorevisionist_dissent += 15

The <span style="color: #0087DC;">**CEDA**</span> and its allies are just another conservative movement that will pass sooner or later; we do not need to build a specific policy to combat them.

@economic_crisis
title: We must address the economic crisis first.
view-if: economic_plan == 0 and black_thursday_seen == 1
go-to: crisis_program

@major_crisis
view-if: nazi_urgency < 5
on-arrival: nazi_urgency += 1; neorevisionist_dissent -= 5; neorevisionist_strength += 5

The authoritarian right is one of the foremost threats to the Republic. However, we are still formulating a strategy to confront it, and still trying to build consensus within our party for action. Check back on this later.

@iron_front
title: Form the Alianza Obrera!
subtitle: The Alianza Obrera unites the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span>, the <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT**</span>, and the militia.
view-if: nazi_urgency >= 3 and iron_front_formed == 0
on-arrival: iron_front_formed = 1; radicalization += 1; nazi_urgency += 1; industrial_psoe += 5*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 5*(1-dissent); left_dissent -= 8; neorevisionist_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_strength += 5
achievement: eiserne_front

The authoritarian threat can no longer be ignored. We must build a new organization to confront it - the Alianza Obrera (Workers' Alliance) - uniting the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span>, the <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT**</span>, and our militia.

What does this alliance stand for?

- @unity: Unity, discipline, and mobilization of the working class.
- @anti: Opposition to <span style="color: #003755;">clerical reaction</span>, <span style="color: #14322a;">fascism</span>, and <span style="color: #808080;">monarchism</span>.
- @orgs: The <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span>, the <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT**</span>, and the militia, united.
- @all: All of the above.

@unity
go-to: if_end

@anti
go-to: if_end

@orgs
go-to: if_end

@all
go-to: if_end

@if_end

The Alianza Obrera has given a new energy to our party.
